    "title": "West Bay Group Plans 'No Kings' Protest in EG Saturday - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By egnews ,\n1 hours ago West Bay Blue Wave has announced it is holding a “No Kings” protest Saturday, Oct. 18, from 1 to 3 p.m. at Cliff Street and First Avenue in East Greenwich. There is precedent. In 2020, there were a couple Black Lives Matter protests at that spot, at the bottom of Eldredge Field near the World War II Memorial. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
